# Moral-choice scenes (WP-C1: choices/engine.js, choices/events_c1.js, design/data/choices.toml). `ttl choice expect`,
# `ttl roads expect`, `ttl karma ... expect` and `ttl rep expect` print "ttl: ..." when wrong, which `server.sh test-all`
# counts as a failure. A takes the routes; B stands 10 blocks away (a Life 2 witness, R14, and a non-participant inside the
# 48-block credit radius). The platform at 1500 150 1500 is on the canon continent (a Jura river cell: '~' owned by 'J' in canon_map.txt,
# 640 blocks from Tempest) and far from every canon build, so no ttl.npc witnesses. Bots never count in the World Chronicle without its test mark, so the
# balance notes are counted (last_noted, tide_dark) but the world does not move. Discord is muted in tests.
ttlbot spawn TtlBotChoiceA
ttlbot spawn TtlBotChoiceB
@sleep 3
ttl reset TtlBotChoiceA
ttl reset TtlBotChoiceB
@sleep 3
ttl roads test TtlBotChoiceA reset
ttl roads test TtlBotChoiceB reset
ttl choice reset TtlBotChoiceA
ttl choice reset TtlBotChoiceB
# Real players' scenes stay out of the run: counted, capped and cleared are only the test's own (ops / TtlBot*).
ttl choice testonly on
ttl roads test TtlBotChoiceA life2
ttl roads test TtlBotChoiceB life2
gamemode creative TtlBotChoiceA
gamemode creative TtlBotChoiceB
execute in minecraft:overworld run forceload add 1440 1480 1560 1520
execute in minecraft:overworld run fill 1440 150 1480 1560 150 1520 minecraft:stone
execute in minecraft:overworld run fill 1440 151 1480 1560 156 1520 minecraft:air
execute in minecraft:overworld run tp TtlBotChoiceA 1500 151 1500
execute in minecraft:overworld run tp TtlBotChoiceB 1510 151 1500
@sleep 2
ttl choice clear
ttl choice testonline 1
ttl choice expect world events 4
ttl choice expect world open 0
# 1. The sick village, the good road: six villagers (one soul online), healed one by one; A pays, B only saw it.
ttl rep set TtlBotChoiceA blumund 0
ttl rep set TtlBotChoiceA tempest 0
ttl rep set TtlBotChoiceA holy_church 0
ttl choice spawn sick_village 1500 151 1500
ttl choice expect scene last n_villagers 6
ttl choice expect scene last alive_villagers 6
ttl choice expect scene last state open
ttl choice expect player TtlBotChoiceA can_last.release no
ttl choice test TtlBotChoiceA heal last 3
ttl choice expect scene last prog_cured 3
ttl choice expect scene last state open
ttl choice test TtlBotChoiceA heal last 3
ttl choice expect scene last state good
ttl choice expect scene last route heal
ttl choice expect scene last actor TtlBotChoiceA
ttl choice expect scene last paid_TtlBotChoiceA yes
ttl choice expect scene last paid_TtlBotChoiceB no
ttl choice expect scene last saw_TtlBotChoiceB yes
ttl rep expect TtlBotChoiceA blumund value 8
ttl rep expect TtlBotChoiceA tempest value 4
ttl roads expect TtlBotChoiceA order2 1
ttl roads expect TtlBotChoiceA last_renown 3
ttl choice expect player TtlBotChoiceA done_sick_village.good 1
ttl choice expect player TtlBotChoiceA last_route heal
ttl choice clear
# 2. The sick village, the dark shortcut: release needs necromancy; it costs the five costs (renown: B saw it).
ttl rep set TtlBotChoiceA blumund 0
ttl rep set TtlBotChoiceA holy_church 0
ttl roads test TtlBotChoiceA reset
ttl choice spawn sick_village 1500 151 1500
ttl choice expect player TtlBotChoiceA can_last.release no
ttl choice test TtlBotChoiceA skill necro
ttl choice expect player TtlBotChoiceA can_last.release yes
ttl choice expect player TtlBotChoiceB can_last.release no
ttl choice act TtlBotChoiceA last release
ttl choice expect scene last state dark
ttl choice expect scene last route release
ttl choice expect scene last prog_released 6
ttl choice expect scene last alive_villagers 0
ttl roads expect TtlBotChoiceA chaos2 6
ttl karma TtlBotChoiceA expect chaos2 6
ttl rep expect TtlBotChoiceA blumund value -15
ttl rep expect TtlBotChoiceA holy_church value -10
ttl roads expect TtlBotChoiceA last_witnesses 1
ttl roads expect TtlBotChoiceA last_renown -5
ttl roads expect TtlBotChoiceA first_choice.sick_village.dark yes
ttl choice expect player TtlBotChoiceA last_noted 2
ttl choice expect player TtlBotChoiceA tide_dark 3
ttl choice test TtlBotChoiceA skill none
ttl choice clear
# 3. Scale (three souls online: 6 + 2 x 2 villagers, rewards x2), the O-C1 cap of three open scenes, the neutral end.
ttl choice testonline 3
ttl choice spawn sick_village 1460 151 1500
ttl choice expect scene last n_villagers 10
ttl choice expect scene last mult 2
ttl choice testonline 1
ttl choice spawn wants_name 1500 151 1500
ttl choice spawn starving_band 1540 151 1500
ttl choice expect world open 3
ttl choice expect world room 0
ttl choice resolve last neutral
ttl choice expect scene last state neutral
ttl choice expect scene last alive_orcs 0
ttl choice expect world open 2
ttl choice expect world room 1
ttl choice clear
# 4. Bandit hostages: clear the camp and cut the bonds (good, the hostages' home faction pays), or the dark deal.
ttl rep set TtlBotChoiceA blumund 0
ttl rep set TtlBotChoiceA orc_horde 0
ttl choice spawn bandit_hostages 1500 151 1500
ttl choice test TtlBotChoiceA home last blumund
ttl choice expect scene last n_hostages 3
ttl choice expect scene last n_bandits 6
ttl choice expect scene last n_captain 1
ttl choice expect scene last home blumund
ttl choice expect player TtlBotChoiceA can_last.take yes
ttl choice expect player TtlBotChoiceA can_last.pay no
ttl choice test TtlBotChoiceA kill last bandits
ttl choice expect scene last prog_cleared false
ttl choice test TtlBotChoiceA kill last captain
ttl choice expect scene last prog_cleared true
ttl choice expect player TtlBotChoiceA can_last.take no
ttl choice test TtlBotChoiceA free last
ttl choice expect scene last state good
ttl choice expect scene last route rescue
ttl rep expect TtlBotChoiceA blumund value 6
ttl roads expect TtlBotChoiceA last_renown 2
ttl choice clear
ttl rep set TtlBotChoiceA blumund 0
ttl roads test TtlBotChoiceA reset
ttl choice spawn bandit_hostages 1500 151 1500
ttl choice test TtlBotChoiceA home last blumund
ttl choice act TtlBotChoiceA last take
ttl choice expect scene last state dark
ttl choice expect scene last prog_killed 3
ttl roads expect TtlBotChoiceA chaos2 9
ttl rep expect TtlBotChoiceA blumund value -20
ttl roads expect TtlBotChoiceA last_renown -6
# O-C2: 3 balance points were used by the release today, so only one of the three dark notes (1.5 each) fits under 5.
ttl choice expect player TtlBotChoiceA last_noted 1
ttl choice expect player TtlBotChoiceA tide_dark 4.5
ttl choice clear
# 5. The starving band: feed (good), absorb (grey: Predator is Tensura's own mechanic, no cost), devour (dark).
ttl rep set TtlBotChoiceA tempest 0
ttl rep set TtlBotChoiceA orc_horde 0
ttl choice spawn starving_band 1500 151 1500
ttl choice expect scene last n_orcs 5
ttl choice expect scene last prog_need 30
ttl choice test TtlBotChoiceA feed last 20
ttl choice expect scene last state open
ttl choice test TtlBotChoiceA feed last 10
ttl choice expect scene last state good
ttl choice expect scene last route feed
ttl rep expect TtlBotChoiceA orc_horde value 10
ttl rep expect TtlBotChoiceA tempest value 5
ttl choice clear
ttl rep set TtlBotChoiceA orc_horde 0
ttl choice spawn starving_band 1500 151 1500
ttl choice expect player TtlBotChoiceA can_last.absorb no
ttl choice test TtlBotChoiceA skill "tensura:predator"
ttl choice expect player TtlBotChoiceA can_last.absorb yes
ttl choice act TtlBotChoiceA last absorb
ttl choice expect scene last state grey
ttl choice expect scene last alive_orcs 0
ttl rep expect TtlBotChoiceA orc_horde value 0
ttl choice test TtlBotChoiceA skill none
ttl choice clear
ttl roads test TtlBotChoiceA reset
ttl choice spawn starving_band 1500 151 1500
ttl choice test TtlBotChoiceA kill last orcs
ttl choice expect scene last state dark
ttl choice expect scene last route devour
ttl roads expect TtlBotChoiceA chaos2 4
ttl rep expect TtlBotChoiceA orc_horde value -10
ttl choice clear
# 6. The wounded monster: heal and name (good; it stays as the soul's own), bind by force, or kill it (dark).
ttl roads test TtlBotChoiceA reset
ttl choice spawn wants_name 1500 151 1500
ttl choice expect scene last n_beast 1
ttl choice test TtlBotChoiceA heal last
ttl choice expect scene last prog_healed true
ttl choice expect scene last part_TtlBotChoiceA healed
ttl choice test TtlBotChoiceA owner last name
ttl choice expect scene last state good
ttl choice expect scene last route name
ttl roads expect TtlBotChoiceA order2 1
ttl roads expect TtlBotChoiceA last_renown 3
ttl choice clear
execute in minecraft:overworld run kill @e[tag=ttl.wants_name]
ttl choice spawn wants_name 1500 151 1500
ttl choice test TtlBotChoiceA owner last bind
ttl choice expect scene last state dark
ttl choice expect scene last route bind
ttl roads expect TtlBotChoiceA chaos2 2
ttl choice clear
execute in minecraft:overworld run kill @e[tag=ttl.wants_name]
ttl choice spawn wants_name 1500 151 1500
ttl choice test TtlBotChoiceA kill last beast
ttl choice expect scene last state dark
ttl choice expect scene last route slay
ttl roads expect TtlBotChoiceA chaos2 4
ttl choice expect player TtlBotChoiceA done_wants_name.dark 2
ttl choice clear
ttl choice expect world active 0
# Clean up.
ttl choice testonline 0
ttl choice testonly off
execute in minecraft:overworld run kill @e[tag=ttl.wants_name]
execute in minecraft:overworld run forceload remove 1440 1480 1560 1520
ttl choice reset TtlBotChoiceA
ttl choice reset TtlBotChoiceB
ttl roads test TtlBotChoiceA reset
ttl roads test TtlBotChoiceB reset
ttl reset TtlBotChoiceA
ttl reset TtlBotChoiceB
ttlbot remove TtlBotChoiceA
ttlbot remove TtlBotChoiceB
